          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Justify why the two angles are equal. Is there a way to superimpose and check? Can this superimposition be done by folding?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.188,
            0.834,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Each of these equal angles formed are called right angles. So, a straight angle contains two "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "right angles",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
